    "title": "Osprey Atmos AG 65 Backpack",
    "description": "The Osprey Atmos AG 65 is a high-performance backpacking pack designed for comfort and support on long treks. It features the revolutionary Anti-Gravity (AG) system, which seamlessly extends the tensioned backpanel into the hipbelt for lightweight, suspended support. The pack includes a Fit-on-the-Fly harness and hipbelt for a customizable fit, along with versatile storage options such as curved zip side panel access, a floating top lid, and a fabric-reinforced front shove-it pocket. For organization, it offers a zippered sleeping bag compartment with a removable divider and straps for a sleeping pad. It also comes with an included waterproof raincover made with PFC/PFAS-free DWR and bluesign approved materials, and an internal sleeve for a hydration reservoir.",
